      "content": "Granary at Sloeland Farm 1. 967 (Formerly listed as farm buildings) SP 90 SE 5/344            10.11.51. II                        GV 2. C17 or early C18, ground floor rebuilt in red brick and flint rubble.  1st floor timber frame, red brick nogging.  Half hipped old tiled roof,  Included for group value. Sloeland Farmhouse, granary and barn form a group. Listing NGR: SP9678603796"
